            <title>0.19.10</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:44:18 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1910</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.10</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>One quiet mark for meetings.</b> A meeting now shows the same small
      purple waveform everywhere — under Sources, where a task came from, and
      on a meeting that is recording.</li>
  <li><b>Tasks open at the size of your day.</b> Opening a task from Focus no
      longer shrinks the window.</li>
  <li><b>Meetings shows the month</b> next to the week you are looking at.</li>
  <li>Task details no longer say "seen in 2 places" above the places
      themselves.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
